Operator:
  Continuous corrective feedback.
Invariant:
  Stability requires movement.
Generalization:
  Entrepreneurship
  Parenting
  Robotics
  Negotiation
  Leadership
Counterexample:
  Static equilibrium systems.

One lesson.

Five domains.

